flowchart TD
    subgraph HOST["APK Kotlin · dev.arca.probe · DemoActivity"]
        A[SurfaceView<br/>pantalla del teléfono] -->|onTouchEvent| B[escala pantalla→fb<br/>y escribe stdin JSON]
        C["RandomAccessFile.setLength(region)<br/>FileChannel.map MAP_SHARED"] --> D[(filesDir/arca-fb.bin<br/>2 slots seqlock)]
